{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026L4rQ6lod9H1795859991.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港超，高力北區2-1擊敗南區。</p><p></p><p>紅衫北區的黃俊皓，禁區內剷跌對手，17分鐘輸十二碼，南區的高路保域操刀，射中間地波入網。</p><p></p><p>北區5分鐘後就追平，格蘭特接應長傳，心口一控，轉身射入，再2分鐘後，另一次長傳攻勢，古杜拉接應，交給遠柱的艾路保利達射入，24分鐘反先，之後時間再無紀錄，北區維持贏2-1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T10:57:37.884298+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T09:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:35:42.281625+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T10:50:58.254015+00:00","content_hash":"f6b44a40afce62a464dc7adfabd486b6cb8ba29dd5ad8110cc5049fa47f45a8b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}